{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender RNA Definition API.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender RNA Definition API.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender rna definition api blender rna definition api","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender RNA Definition API.md","fileName":"Blender RNA Definition API.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender RNA Definition API","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender RNA Data Architecture]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender RNA Data Architecture","Blender RNA Process Item","Blender makesrna Module","Blender RNA Generated Source","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender RNA Definition API.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender RNA Definition API.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender rna definition api blender rna definition api","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender RNA Definition API.md","fileName":"Blender RNA Definition API.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender RNA Definition API","heading":"Blender RNA Definition API","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The RNA definition API consists of `RNA_def_*` functions used to construct the descriptive records for Blender data. Definition code names wrapped structures, associates them with DNA types, describes interface text, creates properties, and installs refine or update callbacks.\n\nMost of this work occurs during the generator phase rather than in the running application. A [[Blender RNA Process Item]] calls the relevant definition function, and the [[Blender makesrna Module]] converts those declarations into [[Blender RNA Generated Source]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender RNA Data Architecture","Blender RNA Process Item","Blender makesrna Module","Ble